graph TD
    A[Start Training Batch] --> B[Phase 1: Train the EBM Critic]
    B --> C[1. FREEZE LNN Weights]
    C --> D[2. Positive Phase: Get Real Data]
    D --> E(S_real)
    E --> F[EBM]
    F --> G(Energy_Real)

    C --> H[3. Negative Phase: Generate Fake Data]
    H --> I(S_noise)
    I --> J[MCMC Sampler - Langevin Dynamics]
    J --> K(S_fake)
    K --> F[EBM]
    F --> L(Energy_Fake)

    G --> M[4. Calculate EBM Loss]
    L --> M
    M --> N[Loss_EBM = E_Real - E_Fake]
    N --> O[5. Backpropagate & Update EBM Weights]

    O --> P[Phase 2: Train the LNN Generator]
    P --> Q[6. FREEZE EBM Weights]
    Q --> R[7. Get Training Data S_t A_t and S_t+1_true]
    R --> S[LNN - CfC Body]
    S --> T(S_t+1_pred)

    T --> U[8. Calculate LNN Physics Loss]
    R --> U
    U --> V[Loss_Physics = MSE of S_t+1_pred and S_t+1_true]

    T --> W[9. Calculate LNN Energy Loss]
    W --> X(Frozen EBM)
    X --> Y(Loss_Energy)

    V --> Z[10. Calculate Total LNN Loss]
    Y --> Z
    Z --> AA[Loss_LNN_Total = Loss_Physics + beta * Loss_Energy]
    AA --> BB[11. Backpropagate & Update LNN Weights]

    BB --> A

